docs {
  Scenario: A business manager's clients appear with the packages the business manager role carries

    When a service owner looks up the daily leader of a business manager firm
    Then the housing company clients the firm manages are in the list
    And the client the firm holds the eiendom package for carries that package

  This carries across the business manager coverage from the folder this replaces. The package
  set differs by client variant, so the assertion is on membership for the named client rather
  than on a count.
}
